{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [49.6063, 35.44114879999995, 372.6741669257803, 42.11895800000002], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": "Wang et al."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 75.05999999999995, 292.6053352, 119.78099999999995], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "observed  were  tooth  sensitivity  and  mucosal  discomfort.  These reactions  were  mild,  and  the  symptoms  resolved  spontaneously without  any  treatment,  leaving  no  sequelae.  No  serious  adverse events (SAEs) were reported."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 123.02199999999993, 292.68824229999996, 311.74299999999994], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "However,  some  limitations  need  to  be  described.  Although this  study  confirms  the  effectiveness  of  the  Low-concentration Whitestrips, providing important preliminary evidence for a milder and safer treatment, we acknowledge that the lack of data on  long-term  color  stability  is  a  clear  limitation  that  awaits clarification  in  future  longitudinal  studies.  And  despite  training participants in proper use of the whitening strips, home application could not be strictly supervised, potentially introducing  variability  in  adherence  and  technique  that  may have  influenced  bleaching  outcomes.  Furthermore,  the  sample size  was  not  based  on  a  formal  power  calculation.  This  study was designed  as  an  exploratory  trial  due  to  the  absence  of  prior data.  Therefore,  while  the  observed  effects  were  significant,  the study should be considered preliminary. The data from this trial should  serve  as  a  basis  for  power  calculations  in  future,  largescale confirmatory studies."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 315.04099999999994, 292.6531369, 431.76199999999994], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "In conclusion, our research demonstrates that Lowconcentration Whitestrips with 3% HP  not only deliver a satisfactory  bleaching  effect  but  also  enhance  their  efficacy  over time while maintaining a high degree of safety. The findings from both the primary and secondary outcomes assessments reinforce each  other,  providing  a  comprehensive  view  of  the  whitening strips'  performance,  enhancing  the  internal  validity.  Considering the  strong  representativeness  of  the  subjects  we  recruited,  the results can be applied to healthy adults aged 18-55 with extrinsic discoloration on their incisors, thus ensuring the external validity."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 455.40500000000003, 126.80866225000003, 468.284], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "Conclusions"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 483.022, 292.65663340000003, 575.762], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 5, "source": "docling", "text": "In this randomized controlled trial, low-concentration whitestrips containing 3% hydrogen peroxide demonstrated significant  efficacy  for  treating  extrinsic  tooth  discoloration.  The treatment was well-tolerated, with the incidence of adverse events being statistically comparable to the placebo group. These findings provide robust clinical evidence for dentists and patients, establishing these whitestrips as a reliable  at-home whitening option."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 599.405, 215.32156885, 612.284], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 6, "source": "docling", "text": "Data availability statement"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 627.0219999999999, 292.6002214, 659.7805999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 7, "source": "docling", "text": "The original contributions presented in the study are included in  the  article/Supplementary  Material,  further  inquiries  can  be directed to the corresponding author."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 683.424, 154.47685177000002, 696.303], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 8, "source": "docling", "text": "Ethics statement"}, {"bbox": [49.605999999999995, 711.0409999999999, 292.6900000000001, 779.7425], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 9, "source": "docling", "text": "The  studies  involving  humans  were  approved  by  (1)  Ethics Committee  of  West  China  Hospital  of  Stomatology  Sichuan University for the protection of human participants (WCHSIRBD-2023-199).  (2)  Chinese  Clinical  Trial  Registry  (https://www. chictr.org.cn/ (ChiCTR2300073971) (3) National Health Information Platform (http://114.255.48.20/login) (MR-"}, {"bbox": [304.7239, 75.06049999999993, 547.7231358999998, 119.78149999999994], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 10, "source": "docling", "text": "51-23-033324).  The  studies  were  conducted  in  accordance  with the local legislation and institutional requirements. The participants provided their written informed consent to participate in this study."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 143.42399999999998, 436.30453774999984, 156.303], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 11, "source": "docling", "text": "Author contributions"}, {"bbox": [304.7246, 171.04099999999994, 547.7879051000003, 299.7808], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 12, "source": "docling", "text": "YW: Conceptualization, Data curation, Formal analysis, Investigation, Methodology, Writing -original draft. DF: Conceptualization, Data curation, Methodology, Writing -original  draft.  LY:  Data  curation,  Formal  analysis,  Methodology, Writing  -  original  draft.  YZ:  Data  curation,  Formal  analysis, Methodology, Writing -original draft. LZ: Data curation, Formal  analysis,  Methodology,  Writing  -  review  &  editing.  JH: Data curation,  Formal analysis, Methodology, Writing  -  original draft. WY: Conceptualization, Data curation, Funding acquisition,  Methodology,  Project  administration,  Supervision, Writing - review & editing."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 323.424, 355.4749101799999, 336.30299999999994], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 13, "source": "docling", "text": "Funding"}, {"bbox": [304.725, 351.041, 547.7770587, 395.762], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 14, "source": "docling", "text": "The author(s) declared that financial support was received for this  work  and/or  its  publication.  This  research  received  a  grant from  WEIMEIZI  (GUANGDONG)  CO.,  LTD.  The  funder  had no involvement in the research or manuscript."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 419.40500000000003, 423.5093970499999, 432.284], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 15, "source": "docling", "text": "Conflict of interest"}, {"bbox": [304.725, 447.022, 547.7760759000001, 491.74309999999997], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 16, "source": "docling", "text": "WY  has  received  supplies  (low-concentration  Whitestrips) from WEIMEIZI  (GUANGDONG)  CO.,  LTD.  YW  reports statistical  analysis  was  provided  by  Chongqing  Fuzhi  Psychic Medicine Technology Co., Ltd."}, {"bbox": [304.725, 495.041, 547.7860920000002, 527.7433], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 17, "source": "docling", "text": "The remaining author(s) declared that this work was conducted in  the  absence  of  any  commercial  or  financial  relationships  that could be construed as a potential conflict of interest."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 551.386, 456.5920913749999, 564.265], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 18, "source": "docling", "text": "Generative AI statement"}, {"bbox": [304.7246, 579.06, 547.6932073000002, 599.7427], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 19, "source": "docling", "text": "The author(s) declared that generative AI was not used in the creation of this manuscript."}, {"bbox": [304.725, 603.0409999999999, 547.7339090999999, 659.7814999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 20, "source": "docling", "text": "Any alternative text (alt text) provided alongside figures in this article  has  been  generated  by  Frontiers  with  the  support  of artificial  intelligence  and  reasonable  efforts  have  been  made  to ensure accuracy, including review by the authors wherever possible. If you identify any issues, please contact us."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 683.424, 405.1600944499999, 696.303], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 21, "source": "docling", "text": "Publisher's note"}, {"bbox": [304.725, 711.0409999999999, 547.7045322000004, 779.7425], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 8, "seq": 22, "source": "docling", "text": "All  claims  expressed  in  this  article  are  solely  those  of  the authors  and  do  not  necessarily  represent  those  of  their  affiliated organizations,  or  those  of  the  publisher,  the  editors  and  the reviewers.  Any  product  that  may  be  evaluated  in  this  article,  or claim  that  may  be  made  by  its  manufacturer,  is  not  guaranteed or endorsed by the publisher."}], "checksum": "976e20de89413ef85d90333e23b71586e0393c72dc465744a8044d74fad6e935", "content_present": true, "doc_id": "d-ffae5e192586c330", "docling_version": "2.118.0", "engine_version": "2.118.0", "errors": [], "images": [], "page_index": 7, "page_sizes": {"8": [595.280029296875, 841.8900146484375]}, "route": "docling", "schema_version": "v0.1.0", "source_hash": "ffae5e192586c330b0f1ca378793890d7f63ed378c5e49098e39ab7cfeaeccc9", "status": "ok", "tables": [], "timings": {}}